        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Chrome 133 already added `::picker-icon` CSS pseudo-element]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27546</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27546"/>
        <updated>2025-08-14T18:07:55.000Z</updated>
